{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>RUN:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are being chased. Your job is simple. Run away from the noises behind you, collect the keys, and escape. In a series of three levels, find out how to effectively use your speed and grappling hook to get out of these corridors. Explore the ins and outs of the mazes and learn how to handle the entities that may cross your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356520/extras/6219463e5a17113bf98b2b7407f1edc8.poster.avif?t=1733973558\" width=648 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356520/extras/6219463e5a17113bf98b2b7407f1edc8.webm?t=1733973558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356520/extras/6219463e5a17113bf98b2b7407f1edc8.mp4?t=1733973558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>ESCAPE:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only way out is the door made of light. Once all the keys are collected, it will open for you, taking you one step closer to your freedom. However, these monsters won't let you leave easily. Toying with their patience makes them agitated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356520/extras/cb101a938be0138f3a2453c87e666501.poster.avif?t=1733973558\" width=622 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356520/extras/cb101a938be0138f3a2453c87e666501.webm?t=1733973558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356520/extras/cb101a938be0138f3a2453c87e666501.mp4?t=1733973558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >..- -. -.. . .-. ... - .- -. -.. .-.-.-</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3356520?t=1733973558","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356520/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1733973558","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356520/368fd27a1f7638c4c208abca68c1b1f23fcb657d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1733973558","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356520/368fd27a1f7638c4c208abca68c1b1f23fcb657d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1733973558","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3397190,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>RUN:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are being chased. Your job is simple. Run away from the noises behind you, collect the keys, and escape. In a series of three levels, find out how to effectively use your speed and grappling hook to get out of these corridors. Explore the ins and outs of the mazes and learn how to handle the entities that may cross your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356520/extras/6219463e5a17113bf98b2b7407f1edc8.poster.avif?t=1733973558\" width=648 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356520/extras/6219463e5a17113bf98b2b7407f1edc8.webm?t=1733973558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356520/extras/6219463e5a17113bf98b2b7407f1edc8.mp4?t=1733973558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></